Package: com.zeshan.phoneaura
Name: PhoneAura
Version: 0.4.16
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: PhoneAura is a free, modern redesign of the iOS 16 Phone app. Version 0.4.16 is an emergency stability hotfix that removes the crashing global long-press phone-number editing hooks introduced in 0.4.15 and restores the proven 0.4.14 runtime behavior. It preserves the fixed saved-number suggestion area, Number not saved status, corrected Next Solution header logo, original Number Options menu, custom Favorites, smart Recents filters, Contacts, haptics and animations. Available for RootHide and rootless jailbreaks.
Depiction: https://nextjailbreak.com/depictions/phoneaura.html
Homepage: https://nextjailbreak.com/
Maintainer: Next Solution
Author: Next Solution
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
